chirpstack_webhook.description:
{status}

Review the URL ChirpStack should POST uplinks to. The default is HA's auto-detected URL; replace it if you use a reverse proxy, custom domain, or external port.

Make sure the Milesight WT101 codec is loaded on the device profile so `temperature`, `target_temperature`, `motor_position` and `motor_stroke` are decoded into the `object` field.
